      </div>
      <div class="lp-split-text">
        <p class="lp-num">Devotional</p>
        <h2 class="lp-head">The tradition was written to be read.</h2>
        <p class="lp-body">The church wrote for use rather than for the archive. Treatises and commentaries, catechisms and confessions, disputations, sermons and prayers, all of it set down for people who needed to know what to believe and how to say it. Most of it has been out of reach: untranslated, out of print, or shelved in libraries you cannot walk into. It is here now. Read it a page at a time.</p>
        <a href="/the-faith-received/browse/" class="btn btn-primary">Start reading</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

